    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_offchain_body",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 110,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 144,
      "text": "1.  Collect round messages / events  (signup, vote, deactivate)\n2.  Compute witness data for each circuit\n3.  Serialize inputs as felt252 arrays\n4.  Submit  programFile + inputFile  to Atlantic proving service\n5.  Atlantic generates STARK proof and registers fact on Starknet\n6.  Call on-chain contract to consume the registered fact",
      "originalText": "1.  Collect round messages / events  (signup, vote, deactivate)\n2.  Compute witness data for each circuit\n3.  Serialize inputs as felt252 arrays\n4.  Submit  programFile + inputFile  to Atlantic proving service\n5.  Atlantic generates STARK proof and registers fact on Starknet\n6.  Call on-chain contract to consume the registered fact",
      "fontSize": 13,
