    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_onchain_body",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 372,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "•  Stores state commitments  (state, deactivate, tally)\n•  Verifies fact is registered in Integrity FactRegistry\n•  Checks public output matches expected commitment values\n•  Advances round state upon successful verification\n\nDoes NOT replay private computation  |  Does NOT store vote plaintext",
      "originalText": "•  Stores state commitments  (state, deactivate, tally)\n•  Verifies fact is registered in Integrity FactRegistry\n•  Checks public output matches expected commitment values\n•  Advances round state upon successful verification\n\nDoes NOT replay private computation  |  Does NOT store vote plaintext",
